 "insight": [
  "The share of computers in Luxembourg's imports decreased from 13.1% in 2005 to 1.3% in 2025.",
  "The largest share was 19.6% in 2008, and the median share over 2005 to 2025 was 2.0%.",
  "The biggest drop between consecutive years was from 18.6% in 2009 to 5.5% in 2010.",
  "The share in 2024 was 1.2%, close to the 2025 value, showing a stable low level recently.",
  "These values are nominal and not adjusted for price changes, which may affect comparisons over time."
